{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08462","headline":"鲁郡尧祠送张十四游河北 · 李白","name":"鲁郡尧祠送张十四游河北","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛虎伏尺草，虽藏难蔽身。\n有如张公子，肮脏在风尘。\n岂无横腰劒，屈彼淮阴人。\n击筑向北燕，燕歌易水滨。\n归来泰山上，当与尔爲邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}